sometimes.

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:03.910
To live in a society, we have to draw lines
where there are gray areas.

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:10.470
So you probably would have imagine a road
where you go, listen, 100 miles an hour, no

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:14.620
one's going to say 100 miles an hour is a
reasonable speed limit here and no one's going

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.050
to say that it's five.

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:18.850
We're going to set the speed limit at 40.

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:23.260
And certainly if it's dry and clear, you could
probably safely go 55.

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:26.690
If it's dark and icy, you're going to have
to go slower.

00:04:26.690 --> 00:04:28.910
But this is where we're kind of drawing the
line.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:33.780
